        key: myapp/database
        property: DB_PASSWORD

refreshInterval: 1h means External Secrets Operator checks AWS Secrets Manager every 1 hour for changes.
If you change the password in AWS:  DB_PASSWORD = newpassword
the operator will check AWS again within the refresh interval and update the Kubernetes Secret:  oldpassword → newpassword

So simply:
refreshInterval: 1h = synchronize/check the AWS secret every 1 hour.
It does not mean your Pod restarts every hour

target:
  name: app-secret
It means the name of the Kubernetes Secret that External Secrets Operator will create.


remoteRef:
  key: myapp/database
  property: DB_USERNAME

means:   Go to AWS Secrets Manager and find the secret named myapp/database, then get DB_USERNAME.

So AWS has:
{
  "DB_USERNAME": "admin",
  "DB_PASSWORD": "password123"
